  << /ActualText (Flow 1\072 Session Start\nUser taps \042Start Unwind\042 on Phone\050    \002\050    \274\050Phone App sends MQTT message\072\050\173\050  \042action\042\072 \042start\137unwind\042\054\050  \042user\137id\042\072 \042user123\042\054\050  \042timestamp\042\072 \0422025\05502\05517T23\07200\07200Z\042\054\050  \042alarm\137time\042\072 \04207\07230\07200\042\050\175\050    \002\050    \274\050MQTT Broker routes message to\072\050    \034\000\272 Backend Server \050logs session start\051\050    \024\000\272 Bedside Display \050triggers visualization\051\050    \002\050    \274\050Backend Server\072\050    \034\000\272 Stores session start in database\050    \024\000\272 Queries ML Service for user\047s typical threshold\050    \002\050    \274\050Bedside Display\072\050    \034\000\272 Calculates sleep hours\072 alarm\137time \055 current\137time\050    \034\000\272 Starts countdown timer\050    \034\000\272 Begins calming sound playback\050    \024\000\272 Initiates ambient lighting \050warm\054 dimming\051\n\nFlow 2\072 Real\055Time Updates\nEvery 60 seconds\072\050    \002\050    \274\050Bedside Display calculates\072\050    \055 Current time\050    \055 Time until alarm\050    \055 Sleep hours if user sleeps NOW\050    \002\050    \274\050Display updates visualization\072\050    \055 Countdown\072 \0427h 23m\042\050    \055 Time dots visualization \050one dot disappears\051\050    \055 Color gradients shift\050    \002\050    \274\050At learned threshold \050e\056g\056\054 45 minutes\051\072\050    \002\050    \274\050Backend queries ML Service\072\050    \042Has user reached typical threshold\077\042\050    \002\050    \274\050ML Service responds\072\050\173\050  \042threshold\137reached\042\072 true\054\050  \042message\042\072 \042You\047re at 45 minutes \055 your typical point of extended scrolling\042\054\050  \042confidence\042\072 0\05685\050\175\050    \002\050    \274\050Bedside Display shows gentle prompt\nFlow 3\072 Session End\nUser taps \042End Unwind\042 on Bedside Device\050    \002\050    \274\050Bedside Display sends MQTT message\072\050\173\050  \042action\042\072 \042end\137unwind\042\054\050  \042user\137id\042\072 \042user123\042\054\050  \042timestamp\042\072 \0422025\05502\05517T23\07242\07200Z\042\050\175\050    \002\050    \274\050Backend Server\072\050    \034\000\272 Calculates session duration\072 42 minutes\050    \034\000\272 Stores in database\050    \024\000\272 Sends data to ML Service for pattern update\050    \002\050    \274\050ML Service\072\050    \034\000\272 Updates user pattern model\050    \034\000\272 Recalculates typical unwind duration\050    \024\000\272 Adjusts future threshold predictions\050    \002\050    \274\050Bedside Display\072\050    \034\000\272 Transitions sounds\072 calming \222 white noise\050    \034\000\272 Turns off ambient lighting\050    \034\000\272 Arms alarm for morning\050    \024\000\272 Shows \042Good night\042 confirmation\nFlow 4\072 Morning Alarm\nAlarm time reached \05007\07230\07200\051\050    \002\050    \274\050Bedside Display\072\050    \034\000\272 Triggers alarm sound \050gentle\054 escalating\051\050    \034\000\272 \050Optional\072 gradual light brightening\051\050    \024\000\272 Waits for user tap to dismiss\050    \002\050    \274\050User taps to dismiss\050    \002\050    \274\050Bedside Display\072\050    \034\000\272 Stops alarm sound\050    \034\000\272 Sends session completion to Backend\050    \024\000\272 Returns to idle state)
