0Bedside Display sends MQTT message\072\050\173\050  \042action\042\072 \042end\137unwind\042\054\050  \042user\137id\042\072 \042user123\042\054\050  \042timestamp\042\072 \0422025\05502\05517T23\07242\07200Z\042\050\175\050    \002\050    \274\050Backend Server\072\050    \034\000\272 Calculates session duration\072 42 minutes\050    \034\000\272 Stores in database\050    \024\000\272 Sends data to ML Service for pattern update\050    \002\050    \274\050ML Service\072\050    \034\000\272 Updates user pattern model\050    \034\000\272 Recalculates typical unwind duration\050    \024\000\272 Adjusts future threshold predictions\050    \002\050    \274\050Bedside Display\072\050    \034\000\272 Turns off ambient lighting\050    \024\000\272 Shows \042Good night\042 confirmation)
